Acknowledgements
----------------

Switchyard is an independent Rust implementation. Its feature set and several
behavioural details (credential cooldown rules, reasoning-effort conversion
tables, the Responses-over-WebSocket transcript handling) were informed by
studying CLIProxyAPI:

  CLIProxyAPI — https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI
